sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 前端客户端
    participant AC as AuthService
    participant LG as LoginAttemptGuard
    participant AUD as AuditService (独立事务)

    C->>AC: POST /api/v1/auth/login (账号, 口令)
    AC->>LG: blocked(username) 检查 5 分钟窗口
    alt 窗口内连续失败 >= 5 次
        LG-->>AC: 返回已锁定及剩余秒数
        AC->>AUD: record("LOGIN", success=false)
        AC-->>C: HTTP 429 (code=42900)
    else 允许校验
        AC->>AC: 查询 sys_user + BCrypt 校验口令
        alt 用户禁用或口令错误
            AC->>LG: recordFailure(username)
            AC->>AUD: record("LOGIN", success=false)
            AC-->>C: HTTP 401 (code=40100)
        else 认证通过
            AC->>LG: recordSuccess(username) 清零计数
            AC->>AC: JwtService.issue(user) 签发 HS256 JWT
            AC->>AUD: record("LOGIN", success=true)
            AC-->>C: HTTP 200 (Bearer Token + UserView)
        end
    end
